  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Liberia Land Authority</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to Liberia Land Authority</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Increased Availability of Land Information and Services, that also support Customary Land Formalization

Outcome 2: LLA has the Institutional Capacity to Deliver Services through Sustainable, Effective and Efficient Business Processes</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lantm&#xE4;teriet will partner with Liberia Land Authority to achieve two main results: 
Outcome 1: Increased Availability of Land Information and Services, that also support Customary Land Formalization
Outcome 2: LLA has the Institutional Capacity to Deliver Services through Sustainable, Effective and Efficient Business Processes
Through achieving these results, Lantm&#xE4;teriet can contribute to reducing poverty and preventing conflicts in Liberia. Better land management enables more people to cultivate land and increase their own income and local trade. Land dispute is a historical root cause of conflict in the country, which can be prevented through strengthened and just land management.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xE4;r ett samarbete mellan Lantm&#xE4;teriet och Liberia Land Authority som syftar till att uppn&#xE5; tv&#xE5; huvudresultat:

Resultat 1: &#xD6;kad tillg&#xE4;nglighet av markinformation och tj&#xE4;nster, som ocks&#xE5; st&#xF6;der sedvanlig markformalisering

Resultat 2: LLA har den institutionella kapaciteten att leverera tj&#xE4;nster genom h&#xE5;llbara och effektiva aff&#xE4;rsprocesser

Genom dessa resultat kan Lantm&#xE4;teriet bidra till att minska fattigdomen och f&#xF6;rebygga konflikter i Liberia. B&#xE4;ttre markf&#xF6;rvaltning m&#xF6;jligg&#xF6;r f&#xF6;r flera att bruka mark och &#xF6;ka sin egen inkomst och lokal handel. Marktvister &#xE4;r en historisk grundorsak till konflikt i landet, som kan f&#xF6;rebyggas genom st&#xE4;rkt och r&#xE4;ttvismarkf&#xF6;rvaltning.</narrative>
  </description>
